guide forever/alliance/03-darkshore
title Darkshore
faction Alliance
levels 16-21
zone Darkshore
next forever/alliance/04-redridge-mountains

# Visit 3 of the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export,
# 16.4 to 20.5): four loops from Auberdine, then the boat to Stormwind and
# Redridge. Kerlonian, Therylune and Balthule's letter (5321, 945, 967) and
# Trek to Ashenvale (990) are turned in on the route's later Ashenvale visit.
#
# Flow: Auberdine (flight path, hearth) -> the beach -> Auberdine -> the bear
# hills -> Auberdine -> the Blackwood camp, Ameth'Aran, the red crystal,
# Bashal'Aran, the Tower of Althalaxx -> hearth -> the Blackwood camp,
# Ameth'Aran, the southern beaches, the Grove, the red crystal, Cliffspring
# Falls, the northern beaches, Bashal'Aran -> Auberdine -> the bay wrecks, the
# Ruins of Mathystra, the Tower, the cave, the Den Mother -> hearth -> the
# Grove, the Master's Glaive, Murkdeep's beach -> Auberdine -> the naga ->
# hearth -> the Grove, Volcor -> Auberdine.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - For Love Eternal (963) is taken on the first pass through Auberdine and
#   done in Ameth'Aran on the first loop instead of a later return.
# - Refresh (new consensus): The Absent Minded Prospector (729, 731) is
#   taken: Trouble In Darkshore? (730) is only its breadcrumb, Archaeologist
#   Hollee gives 729 directly. Its third step (741) is left out: it ends in
#   Darnassus, a detour off the route, and the chain's last step (943) needs
#   the Stone of Relu, a 1.5% raptor drop in the Wetlands.
# - Refresh: Expanding Horizons (97914, Forever) is taken at the end:
#   Thundris Windweaver's letter goes to Baros Alexston at the Stormwind stop
#   (04-redridge-mountains), his reply (Making Do, 97926, a Shipwright's
#   Satchel) back to Thundris on the return to Auberdine (06-ashenvale).
# - Left out, accepted but never turned in on the route: One Shot. One Kill.
#   (5713): it ends at Maestra's Post, which the route reaches at 25, when
#   the level 15 quest pays a tenth of its XP. The Powers Below (968) starts
#   from a 5% book drop of the Twilight Disciples and Thugs: optional, handed
#   in at the Ironforge stop (06-ashenvale).
# - The Lakeshire flight path and hearth the export lists at the end of this
#   visit are taken on arrival in Redridge (next guide).
# - Holy Diver (87760, Forever): Gwennyth offers it only once all nine
#   Beached Sea Creature and Turtle quests are handed in (a Wowhead Forever
#   comment, #51; the quest data has no prerequisite for it). It is taken
#   with the last three after the fourth loop, its rod comes from the
#   Stormscale Beastmistresses on the naga trip, and it is handed in on the
#   way back south.
#
# Optional: The Family and the Fishing Pole (1141) needs Fishing.
# Gyromast's Revenge (2078) ends with the Threshwackonator 4100, an elite: not
# taken. The Tower of Althalaxx 1143 and 981 need 1167 from Delgren in
# Ashenvale (after 970-973) first: skipped.
#
# Class quests (Druids; Auberdine has the flights to Rut'theran Village and
# Moonglade, the class's own teleport does the rest):
# - Night Elf Druids: A Lesson to Learn and Trial of the Lake (26, 29) after
#   the first hearth, the Darkshore half pendant on the north loop; Trial of
#   the Sea Lion (272) is finished with the Westfall half from the Stormwind
#   stop (04-redridge-mountains) on arrival in Auberdine (06-ashenvale).
# - Night Elf and Skyborne Druids: Cat Form (98393 to 98397, Mathrengyl
#   Bearwalker, the Great Cat Spirit or the Avatar of Saeyleenan in
#   Moonglade) at the end, about level 21, before the boat.
# - Night Elf Druids: Cure Poison (6121-6125: Lessons Anew from Mathrengyl on
#   the A Lesson to Learn trip, the Cliffspring sampler on the north loop,
#   Alanndarian's herbs after the third loop and the deer on the last legs,
#   Power over Poison on the Cat Form trip). Forever rewards Cure Poison only
#   through it. Earthroot needs Herbalism or the Stormwind purchase
#   (02-westfall); the moonkin caves for the Lunar Fungus are Wowhead
#   Forever's (quest 6123), the Lunar Fungal Blooms objects.json's.
# - Skyborne Druids hand Sheldras's Moonglade welcome (94914, from their start
#   guide) to Dendrite on the Cat Form trip.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auberdine

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip The boat docks west of the village. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn; the quest givers are spread along the main street.
  getfp "Auberdine"
  sethome "Auberdine"
  accept 983                                  -- Wizbang Cranktoggle, by the inn
  accept 4811                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  accept 98025                                -- The WANTED poster outside the inn
  accept 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 963                                  -- Cerellean Whiteclaw, on the pier
  accept 1141 optional                        -- Gubber Blump, on the pier: only with Fishing
  accept 2118                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender
  accept 984                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 954                                  -- Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village
  accept 958

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The beach

step The beach
  tip Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village; Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks. Darkshore Threshers swim in the shallows. The Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore just south of the village.
  collect 5385 quest 983                      -- Crawler Legs
  turnin 983                                  -- Buzzbox 827
  accept 1001
  collect 5412 quest 1001                     -- Thresher Eyes
  collect 12242 quest 3524                    -- Sea Creature Bones
  collect 12238 quest 1141 optional @36.1,44.9 -- Darkshore Grouper: fish from the pier

step Auberdine
  turnin 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 4681
  turnin 1141 optional                        -- Gubber Blump

step The skeletal turtle
  collect 12289 quest 4681                    -- Sea Turtle Remains, on the beach west of the docks
  turnin 4681                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde

step Plagued bears
  tip Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills just east of Auberdine. Use Tharnariun's Hope on one and lead it back to him.
  complete 2118
  turnin 2118                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender
  accept 2138

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- First loop: south-east and north-east

step Bears and the Blackwood camp
  tip Kill Rabid Thistle Bears in the hills east of Auberdine, then walk up to the furbolg camp south-east of them: nothing to kill yet.
  kill 2164 quest 2138
  complete 984

step Ameth'Aran
  tip Sentinel Tysha Moonblade stands at the north edge of the ruins. Cursed, Writhing and Wailing Highborne haunt them; Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks among them, Jai'vhanel the owl circles east of them. The two tablets lie in the ruins; a Beached Sea Turtle lies on the shore west of them.
  accept 953                                  -- Sentinel Tysha Moonblade
  complete 953                                -- Read both tablets
  collect 5360 quest 958                      -- Highborne Relics
  collect 5382 quest 963                      -- Anaya's Pendant
  collect 281038 quest 98025                  -- Feather of Jai'vhanel
  turnin 953
  accept 4722                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle

step The red crystal
  tip Climb the eastern mountains east of Ameth'Aran; the Mysterious Red Crystal sits on a ledge.
  interact 175524 quest 4811.1                -- Mysterious Red Crystal
  complete 4811

step Bashal'Aran
  tip North along the hills. Asterion waits in the ruins of Bashal'Aran; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. Buzzbox 411 stands by the road west of the ruins.
  turnin 954                                  -- Asterion
  accept 955
  collect 5336 quest 955                      -- Grell Earrings
  turnin 955
  accept 956
  collect 5338 quest 956                      -- Ancient Moonstone Seal: Deth'ryll Satyrs
  turnin 956
  accept 957
  turnin 1001                                 -- Buzzbox 411
  accept 1002

step The Tower of Althalaxx
  tip Moonstalkers prowl the hills between Bashal'Aran and the tower. Buzzbox 323 stands on the hill west of the tower; Grizzled Thistle Bears roam around it.
  collect 5413 quest 1002                     -- Moonstalker Fangs
  turnin 1002                                 -- Buzzbox 323
  accept 1003
  collect 5414 quest 1003                     -- Grizzled Scalps

step Hearth to Auberdine
  hearth "Auberdine"
  turnin 984                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 985
  accept 4761
  turnin 2138                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender
  turnin 4811                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  turnin 98025
  accept 4812
  turnin 4761                                 -- Thundris Windweaver
  turnin 958
  accept 4762
  turnin 4722                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  turnin 963                                  -- Cerellean Whiteclaw
  collect 14339 quest 4812                    -- Fill the tube at the moonwell in the village
  vendor nearest

step A Lesson to Learn
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village and take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave.
  fly "Rut'theran Village"
  accept 26                                   -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker
  accept 6121                                 -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Lessons Anew

step Trial of the Lake
  only NightElf,Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of Lake Elune'ara, below Nighthaven: take one to the Shrine of Remulos in the north-west, use it there and speak to Tajarri. Then fly back to Auberdine from Nighthaven.
  turnin 26                                   -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 6121
  accept 6122                                 -- The Principal Source: fill the sampler at Cliffspring Falls
  accept 29
  collect 15877 x1                            -- Shrine Bauble, from a Bauble Container in the lake
  use 15877 @36.0,41.4                        -- At the Shrine of Remulos
  complete 29
  turnin 29                                   -- Tajarri
  accept 272                                  -- The half pendants lie in Darkshore and Westfall: later on the route
  fly "Auberdine"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Second loop

step Blackwood furbolgs
  zone Darkshore
  tip Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of Auberdine.
  kill 2167 quest 985
  kill 2324 quest 985

step The Ancient Flame
  tip The flame burns in the south of Ameth'Aran.
  interact 16393 quest 957.1                  -- Ancient Flame

step The southern beaches
  tip Follow the coast south past Ameth'Aran: one Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore west of the Grove, another further south near Remtravel's Excavation.
  accept 4728                                 -- Beached Sea Creature
  accept 4730                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step The Grove of the Ancients
  tip Buzzbox 525 stands west of the Grove.
  turnin 1003                                 -- Buzzbox 525

step The red crystal
  tip Back north-east into the mountains to the crystal.
  turnin 4812                                 -- Mysterious Red Crystal
  accept 4813

step Cliffspring Falls
  tip Follow the hills north to the Cliffspring River and up to the falls. Three more beached remains lie on the north shore: near the Ruins of Mathystra, north of Bashal'Aran and west of Bashal'Aran.
  collect 12349 quest 4762                    -- Cliffspring River Sample, at the waterfall
  collect 15845 quest 6122.1 only NightElf,Druid -- Filled Cliffspring Falls Sampler: at the mouth of the cave by the falls
  accept 4727                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 4725                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 4723                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step Bashal'Aran
  turnin 957                                  -- Asterion

step Auberdine
