# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Third loop: the north

step The bay wrecks
  tip Two wrecks lie on the sea floor in the bay north of Auberdine; each holds a lockbox. Reef Crawlers and Encrusted Tide Crawlers line this shore.
  collect 12191 quest 982                     -- Silver Dawning's Lockbox
  collect 12192 quest 982                     -- Mist Veil's Lockbox
  collect 12237 quest 1138                    -- Fine Crab Chunks

step The Ruins of Mathystra
  tip Gelkak Gyromast hides on the little island off the ruins. The key pieces drop from Giant Foreststriders (top), Greymist murlocs (middle) and Raging Reef Crawlers (bottom).
  accept 2098                                 -- Gelkak Gyromast
  collect 7498 quest 2098
  collect 7499 quest 2098
  collect 7500 quest 2098
  turnin 2098
  collect 15883 x1 only NightElf,Druid        -- Half Pendant of Aquatic Agility: the Strange Lockbox under the water off the north coast, west of the ruins

step The Tower of Althalaxx
  tip Balthule Shadowstrike hides at the foot of the tower among the Dark Strand Fanatics. Keep his letter for Delgren in Ashenvale.
  turnin 965                                  -- Balthule Shadowstrike
  accept 966
  collect 5348 quest 966                      -- Worn Parchment: Dark Strand Fanatics
  turnin 966
  accept 967

step The cave and the Den Mother
  tip The cave lies south of the falls: Scaber Stalks grow all through it, the Death Cap at the very back. The Den Mother lairs in the hills south of the falls; Xabraxxis' Demon Bag lies at the satyr camp north of her.
  collect 5271 quest 947                      -- Scaber Stalks
  collect 5270 quest 947                      -- Death Cap
  collect 12355 quest 4763                    -- Talisman of Corruption, in Xabraxxis' Demon Bag
  kill 6788 quest 2139                        -- Den Mother

step Hearth to Auberdine
  hearth "Auberdine"
  accept 729                                  -- Archaeologist Hollee
  turnin 2139                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender
  turnin 947                                  -- Barithras Moonshade
  accept 948
  turnin 982                                  -- Gorbold Steelhand
  turnin 4763                                 -- Thundris Windweaver
  turnin 1138                                 -- Gubber Blump
  vendor nearest

step Lunar Fungus and Earthroot
  only NightElf,Druid
  tip The Lunar Fungal Blooms grow in the moonkin caves in the hills just east of Auberdine; the moonkin there are irritable. Earthroot needs Herbalism: herbalists pick it all over Darkshore, anyone else brings it from Stormwind (Maria Lumere) or the Auction House.
  collect 15851 x12 quest 6123.2              -- Lunar Fungus
  collect 2449 x5 quest 6123.1                -- Earthroot

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Fourth loop: the south

step The Grove of the Ancients
  tip Follow the road south. Onu is the ancient at the Grove; Arbal and Kerlonian Evershade sleep beside him.
  turnin 948                                  -- Onu
  accept 944
  accept 98013                                -- Arbal
  accept 5321                                 -- Kerlonian Evershade: his escort to Maestra's Post is done on the Ashenvale leg

step The Master's Glaive
  tip Moonstalker Sires prowl the woods around the glaive. The Scrying Bowl and the Twilight Tome sit at the bottom of the crater; Therylune stands on its north side.
  collect 5386 quest 986                      -- Fine Moonstalker Pelts
  complete 944
  turnin 944                                  -- The Scrying Bowl
  accept 949
  turnin 949                                  -- The Twilight Tome
  accept 950
  accept 98042
  collect 279279 quest 98042                  -- Peerless Eye: Twilight Disciples and Thugs
  accept 968 optional                         -- Only if a Disciple or Thug dropped Book: The Powers Below: right-click it
  accept 945                                  -- Therylune
  complete 945                                -- Escort her out of the glaive; Therysil takes the turn-in in Ashenvale

step Murkdeep's beach
  tip Murkdeep camps on the beach west of the glaive: kill the murlocs at the camp fire; he comes in the third wave with his hound. Three beached remains lie on the beaches south of Remtravel's Excavation.
  kill 10323 quest 4740                       -- Murkdeep
  accept 4731                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 4732                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 4733                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step Prospector Remtravel
  tip Remtravel's Excavation lies on the coast south of Murkdeep's beach. Protect the prospector while he searches for the fossil.
  turnin 729                                  -- Prospector Remtravel
  accept 731
  complete 731

step The Grove of the Ancients
  turnin 950                                  -- Onu
  accept 951

step Auberdine
  tip Follow the road north.
  turnin 731                                  -- Archaeologist Hollee
  turnin 4731                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  turnin 4732
  turnin 4733
  accept 87760                                -- Holy Diver: Gwennyth offers it once all nine beached remains are handed in
  turnin 4740                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  turnin 6123 only NightElf,Druid             -- Alanndarian Nightsong
  accept 6124 only NightElf,Druid             -- She gives you the Curative Animal Salve
  turnin 98042                                -- Thundris Windweaver
  turnin 986                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 993
  vendor nearest

step The naga
  tip Follow the coast north-east to the Ruins of Mathystra. Mathystra Relics lie among the ruins; Stormscale Myrmidons, Sorceresses and Warriors hold them, and Stormscale Beastmistresses walk the shore.
  collect 5273 quest 951                      -- Mathystra Relics
  kill 2181 quest 98013
  kill 2182 quest 98013
  kill 2183 quest 98013
  collect 280686 quest 87760                  -- Rod of Deep Dominion: Stormscale Beastmistress

step Back south
  hearth "Auberdine"                          -- Hearthstone on cooldown? Follow the coast road back south.
  turnin 87760                                -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  turnin 951                                  -- Onu, at the Grove
  turnin 98013                                -- Arbal

step Volcor
  tip Volcor hides in the hills east of the Master's Glaive. Help him back to the road; he fights on his way out.
  turnin 993                                  -- Volcor
  accept 994
  complete 994
  kill 12298 quest 6124.1 only NightElf,Druid -- Sickly Deer: use the Curative Animal Salve on them; they roam all of Darkshore

step Auberdine
  turnin 994                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 990                                  -- Sentinel Selarin: for Raene Wolfrunner in Astranaar, on the later Ashenvale leg
  accept 97914                                -- Thundris Windweaver: for Baros Alexston in Stormwind
  vendor nearest
  goto 30.76,40.92 "Boat to Stormwind"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Druids: Cat Form

step The Great Cat Spirit
  only Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Night Elves fly from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village; Skyborne take the boat from the Auberdine dock and learn the Rut'theran flight path there. Take the portal up to Mathrengyl Bearwalker in the Cenarion Enclave.
  fly "Rut'theran Village" only NightElf
  getfp "Rut'theran Village" only Skyborne
  accept 98393                                -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker

step Dendrite Starblaze
  only Druid
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze is in Nighthaven; learn the flight path there if you do not have it.
  turnin 98393                                -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 98394 only NightElf
  turnin 6124 only NightElf                   -- Dendrite Starblaze
  accept 6125 only NightElf
  accept 98341 only Skyborne
  turnin 94914 only Skyborne                  -- Dendrite Starblaze: the welcome from Sheldras
  getfp "Moonglade"

step The relics of the Barrow Dens
  only Druid
  tip The Great Cat Spirit (Night Elves) and the Avatar of Saeyleenan (Skyborne) wait in southern Moonglade. The three relics lie in the Stormrage Barrow Dens, east of them. Reports from the first weeks say a relic gives no loot while another player is looting it: wait a moment and try again.
  turnin 98394 only NightElf                  -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98396 only NightElf
  turnin 98341 only Skyborne                  -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98404 only Skyborne
  collect 280502 quest 98396.1 @72.4,66.0 only NightElf -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98396.2 @75.2,67.2 only NightElf -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98396.3 @74.4,65.4 only NightElf -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  collect 280502 quest 98404.1 @72.4,66.0 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Fang
  collect 280679 quest 98404.2 @75.2,67.2 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Claw
  collect 280680 quest 98404.3 @74.4,65.4 only Skyborne -- Relic of the Silent Shadow
  turnin 98396 only NightElf                  -- Great Cat Spirit
  accept 98731 only NightElf
  turnin 98404 only Skyborne                  -- Avatar of Saeyleenan
  accept 98738 only Skyborne

step Back to Dendrite
  only Druid
  tip Back to Dendrite Starblaze in Nighthaven, then fly to Rut'theran Village (by way of Auberdine).
  turnin 98731 only NightElf                  -- Dendrite Starblaze
  turnin 98738 only Skyborne
  accept 98397
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step To Darnassus
  only Druid
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to Mathrengyl, then fly back to Auberdine for the boat to Stormwind.
  turnin 98397                                -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cat Form
  turnin 6125 only NightElf                   -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker: Cure Poison
  fly "Auberdine"
